    "text": "The distance of the point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;from the plane&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;measure parallel to the line&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mstyle><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>12</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is",
