  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Equation of line passing through&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and parallel to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mstyle><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>12</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mstyle><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></math></p><p>Any point on this line is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;</p><p>For finding&nbsp;point of intersection of line and a&nbsp;plane, we have</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>27</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Required distance is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msqrt><mn>36</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>64</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>576</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>26</mn></math>&nbsp;units</p>",
